# Template for ~/orbit/web.env on the box (loaded by docker-compose `env_file` for orbit-web).
# This file is committed: keep values EMPTY here. Real values go only in the box's web.env
# (and locally in web/.env.local, which git ignores).

# Google Geocoding API, used by /api/locate to name the visitor's area (Maisammaguda, Bahadurpally, Hyderabad).
# In Google Cloud: enable only the Geocoding API on this key, restrict it to the box's IP, set a daily quota cap.
# Without it the site falls back to BigDataCloud (mandal-level names).
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
